### 参考回答

单项失败不应让其余已接纳请求永久饥饿，因此调度层在 finally 接力。业务层必须先报告失败并保持可诊断信息。如果后续任务依赖前项产物，可在执行前校验依赖状态或取消相关后续项；那是业务依赖规则，不能靠队列“偶然卡住”实现。

### 阅读时用这两处源码核对

按会话建槽位，空闲直接启动，其余进入待执行数组

```text
   93    submit(sessionId: string, runId: string, run: () => Promise<void>): SubmitResult {
   94      let slot = this.slots.get(sessionId)
   95      if (!slot) {
   96        slot = { running: false, queue: [] }
   97        this.slots.set(sessionId, slot)
   98      }
   99  
  100      const done = createDeferred()
  101      let cancelled = false
  102      const wasCancelled = () => cancelled
  103      const wrapped = async () => {
  104        try {
  105          await run()
  106        } finally {
  107          done.resolve()
  108        }
  109      }
  110  
  111      if (!slot.running && slot.queue.length === 0) {
  112        slot.running = true
  113        this.events.onStarted?.(sessionId, runId, false)
  114        void this.execute(sessionId, wrapped)
  115        return { status: 'started', position: 0, done: done.promise, wasCancelled }
  116      }
  117  
  118      slot.queue.push({
  119        runId,
  120        run: wrapped,
  121        resolveDone: done.resolve,
  122        markCancelled: () => { cancelled = true },
  123      })
  124      const position = slot.queue.length
  125      this.events.onEnqueued?.(sessionId, runId, position)
  126      return { status: 'queued', position, done: done.promise, wasCancelled }
```

执行结束后由 drain 接力下一项

```text
  129    private async execute(sessionId: string, run: () => Promise<void>): Promise<void> {
  130      try {
  131        await run()
  132      } catch {
  133        // run 自身负责错误处理 / 上报；队列层只保证不因单条失败而卡死。
  134      } finally {
  135        this.drainNext(sessionId)
  136      }
  137    }
  138  
  139    private drainNext(sessionId: string): void {
  140      const slot = this.slots.get(sessionId)
  141      if (!slot) return
  142      const next = slot.queue.shift()
  143      if (!next) {
  144        slot.running = false
  145        this.slots.delete(sessionId)
  146        this.events.onIdle?.(sessionId)
  147        return
  148      }
  149      // running 保持 true，直接接力下一条。
  150      this.events.onStarted?.(sessionId, next.runId, true)
  151      void this.execute(sessionId, next.run)
  152    }
```

